DISABLED HISTORICAL NOTE - THIS IS NOT A PATCH

An earlier experiment guessed that SPI response 7f9d207f represented a
Pm25LD020 with a 256 KiB capacity and supplied guessed erase opcodes. Neither
the chip identity, geometry nor erase commands were established. The patch was
also malformed, and the attempted extraction did not complete.

Upstream issue https://github.com/BertoldVdb/jms578flash/issues/12 reports the
same response on a different dock whose flash is marked Pm25LQ512. That does
not identify this dock's flash. Do not apply the old configuration or use it
for writing; identify the physical chip and verify its datasheet first.
